# UA92 Junior Software Engineer Interview Simulator

An interactive mock interview tool built for students on the UA92 92 Programme, Block 4: Personal Development.

## What it does

Students answer 10 real interview questions used by tech companies, covering:

- HR & Motivation
- Behavioural (STAR technique)
- Technical fundamentals (stacks, queues, Big O)
- Databases (SQL vs NoSQL)
- Cybersecurity (SQL injection)
- Problem solving (algorithms)
- System design

After submitting all 10 answers, students receive a full Pass / Fail result with score out of 100, grade from Distinction to Fail, question-by-question feedback, strengths and development areas, and personalised next steps.

## How to use

Click the link below — no account, no download, no login needed.

[Open the Interview Simulator](https://iqraashrafkiyani.github.io/ua92-interview)

